2.Write a query to show total revenue and average order value per restaurant.

select name, SUM(total_amount), avg(total_amount)
from restaurants,orders
where restaurants.restaurant_id=orders.restaurant_id
group by name;

3.Write a query using HAVING to list only restaurants whose total revenue exceeds Rs 5,000.

select name, SUM(total_amount)
from restaurants, orders
where restaurants.restaurant_id=orders.restaurant_id
group by name
having SUM(total_amount)>5000;


4.Write a query to retrieve the 5 most recent orders using ORDER BY and LIMIT

select*from orders 
order by order_date desc 
limit 5;
